The AddAdoNetGrainDirectory extension method we want to test is an extension on IServiceCollection, but it is internal. The public API to add the grain directory is on ISiloBuilder, which calls this internal method on IServiceCollection.

To test the internal IServiceCollection extension, I need to test it indirectly via ISiloBuilder extensions or make the internal method accessible for testing. Since the internal method is in an internal static class, I cannot call it directly from the test.

I will test the public ISiloBuilder extension AddAdoNetGrainDirectory that calls the internal IServiceCollection extension. This will cover the call to GetRequiredService inside the internal method.

I will create a minimal mock/fake ISiloBuilder that captures the ConfigureServices call and invokes the IServiceCollection extension. This will allow me to verify the IServiceCollection extension behavior.

I will submit a test file that tests the ISiloBuilder.AddAdoNetGrainDirectory extension and indirectly covers the internal IServiceCollection extension method and the call to GetRequiredService.

